Aerie-Purpose: Let a frame's renderer reach the cosmetic tab helper of its tab, so the renderer's late-element reports arrive in the browser process (ADR 0005).
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/browser/chrome_content_browser_client_receiver_bindings.cc (RegisterAssociatedInterfaceBindersForRenderFrameHost), chrome/browser/BUILD.gn (core deps)
Aerie-Kind: hook

One call that registers the CosmeticHost associated interface binder for each RenderFrameHost, next to
the other tab helpers' binders. Everything it does is in chrome/browser/aerie_adblock/
aerie_cosmetic_tab_helper.cc (the overlay): the report is untrusted, bounded and rate limited there.

